// testing requests
### Logging

POST http://localhost:3500/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":  "YourUsername", "password":  "YourPassword"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Logging out

POST http://localhost:3500/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listing series
GET http://localhost:3500/api/series

### POST series
POST http://localhost:3500/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Warszawa", "minValue": -40, "maxValue": 50, "color": "#1F33BA"}

### GET an existing seriesId → 200
GET http://localhost:3500/api/series/2

### DELETE /api/series/seriesId
DELETE http://localhost:3500/api/series/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PUT /api/series/seriesId
PUT http://localhost:3500/api/series/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Warszawa-2", "minValue": -30, "maxValue": 50, "color": "#1F53BA", "icon":  "circle"}


### Sensor testing getting a list
GET http://localhost:3500/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST sensor into /api/sensors
POST http://localhost:3500/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Sensor-Warszawa-1", "seriesId":  2}

> {% client.global.set("apiKey", response.body.apiKey); %}

### GET /api/sensors/{sensorId}
GET http://localhost:3500/api/sensors/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE /api/sensors/{sensorId}
DELETE http://localhost:3500/api/sensors/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

// FULL TESTING ROUTE:

### P1. Logowanie
POST http://localhost:3500/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "YourUsername", "password": "YourPassword"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### P2. Seria A
POST http://localhost:3500/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Test A", "minValue": 0, "maxValue": 100, "color": "#1f77b4"}

> {% client.global.set("seriesA", response.body.id); %}

### P3. Czujnik serii A
POST http://localhost:3500/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Czujnik A", "seriesId": {{seriesA}}}

> {% client.global.set("apiKeyA", response.body.apiKey); %}

### P4. Wynik A o 10:00
POST http://localhost:3500/api/measurements
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 20, "timestamp": "2026-01-10T10:00:00Z"}

> {% client.global.set("measurementA", response.body.id); %}

### P5. Wynik A o 11:00
POST http://localhost:3500/api/measurements
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 21, "timestamp": "2026-01-10T11:00:00Z"}

### P6. Wynik A o 12:00
POST http://localhost:3500/api/measurements
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 22, "timestamp": "2026-01-10T12:00:00Z"}

### P7. Seria B
POST http://localhost:3500/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Test B", "minValue": 0, "maxValue": 100, "color": "#ff7f0e"}

> {% client.global.set("seriesB", response.body.id); %}

### P8. Czujnik serii B
POST http://localhost:3500/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Czujnik B", "seriesId": {{seriesB}}}

> {% client.global.set("apiKeyB", response.body.apiKey); %}

### P9. Wynik B o 11:30
POST http://localhost:3500/api/measurements
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 50, "timestamp": "2026-01-10T11:30:00Z"}


### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements/{{measurementA}}

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements/9999999

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements?series={{seriesA}}

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements?series={{seriesA}}&sort=-timestamp

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements?series={{seriesA}}&from=2026-01-10T11:00:00Z&to=2026-01-10T11:00:00Z

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements?series={{seriesA}}&from=2026-01-10T12:00:00%2B01:00&to=2026-01-10T12:00:00%2B01:00

### GET /api/measurements
GET http://localhost:3500/api/measurements?series={{seriesA}},{{seriesB}}

### PUT /api/measurements
PUT http://localhost:3500/api/measurements/{{measurementA}}

### DELETE /api/measurements
DELETE http://localhost:3500/api/measurements/{{measurementA}}

####

### 406
GET http://localhost:3500/api/series
Accept: application/xml

### 415
POST http://localhost:3500/api/measurements
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyA}}
Content-Type: text/plain

value=1

### Wylogowanie bez treści, nadal 204 (nie 415)
POST http://localhost:3500/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}